# Implementation Plan - Fullstack HMS Migration

Transition the current frontend-only HMS application into a robust fullstack system. This will provide persistent data storage, role-based security, and support for complex queries like medical reports and machine maintenance schedules.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Database Choice**: As per the project constraint, we will use **MySQL**. This is well-suited for the complex relational queries (Patient -> Doctor -> Medical Records) required by a hospital management system.
> **Backend Choice**: Since you already have an initial skeleton for **Node.js/Express**, I will build upon that as it integrates seamlessly with your React code and works perfectly with MySQL via Prisma.

## Proposed Changes

### [Backend] server

Initialize and expand the Node.js backend.

#### [MODIFY] [schema.prisma](file:///c:/Users/naman/HMS/server/prisma/schema.prisma)
- Update provider to `mysql`.
- Define models:
    - `User`: Handles authentication and roles (`DOCTOR`, `NURSE`, `ADMIN`, `PATIENT`).
    - [Patient](file:///c:/Users/naman/HMS/src/pages/EmployeeDashboard.jsx#36-41): Demographics linked to `User`.
    - [Employee](file:///c:/Users/naman/HMS/src/pages/EmployeeDashboard.jsx#27-457): Staff details linked to `User`.
    - `MedicalRecord`: Diagnoses and admission status.
    - `LabResult`: Linked to medical records.
    - `Appointment`: Scheduling link between Doctor and Patient.
    - `Machine`: Inventory/Equipment tracking.
    - `MaintenanceSchedule`: Logs for machine maintenance, linked to `Machine`.

#### [NEW] [index.js](file:///c:/Users/naman/HMS/server/index.js)
- Core Express server setup.
- Routes for `/api/patients`, `/api/records`, `/api/appointments`, and `/api/machines`.

#### [NEW] [seed.js](file:///c:/Users/naman/HMS/server/prisma/seed.js)
- A script to migrate existing data from [src/data/hmsData.js](file:///c:/Users/naman/HMS/src/data/hmsData.js) into the MySQL database.

---

### [Frontend] src

Connect the UI to the new backend.

#### [MODIFY] [EmployeeDashboard.jsx](file:///c:/Users/naman/HMS/src/pages/EmployeeDashboard.jsx)
- Replace mock data imports with `useEffect` fetch calls.
- Add Machine Maintenance view logic.

#### [NEW] [api.js](file:///c:/Users/naman/HMS/src/services/api.js)
- A central service to handle axios/fetch calls with proper error handling and base URL configuration.

